# iCloud duplicates: ~/Desktop is synced and clones build dirs as "out 2"
/out */

# iCloud duplicate files. ~/Desktop is synced and iCloud clones a file as
# "name 2.ext" whenever it sees a local write race — committing one blog post
# reliably produces a " 2" twin. They are byte-identical garbage, never real
# work, and they polluted every `git status` on this repo.
* 2
* 3
* 2.*
* 3.*
